State funded capital construction. 25LSO-0556, 1.0
FISCAL NOTE
This bill contains appropriations of $165,771,697 from the STRATEGIC INVESTMENTS
AND PROJECTS ACCOUNT to the State Construction Department. These appropriations
are effective immediately.
This bill contains appropriations of $25,706,953 from PRIVATE FUNDS to the State
Construction Department. These appropriations are effective immediately.
This bill contains a transfer of $154,303,404 from the LEGISLATIVE STABILIZATION
RESERVE ACCOUNT to the STRATEGIC INVESTMENTS AND PROJECTS ACCOUNT. This transfer
is effective immediately.
This bill contains funding for 2 previously authorized at-will contract employee
positions.
